node277 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>metricDecisionThreshold</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/metricDecisionThreshold' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/metricDecisionThreshold</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;Threshold that was used for computation of a metric described in
the metric field.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;Threshold that was used for computation of a metric described in
the metric field.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Each metric can be computed based on a decision threshold.

For instance, precision or recall is typically computed by checking if the
probability of the outcome is larger than 0.5.

Each decision threshold shall match with a metric field defined in the AI
package.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
