# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/serviceHostingCountry node1518
node1518 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>serviceHostingCountry</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/serviceHostingCountry' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/serviceHostingCountry</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies a country code where a software service is hosted.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies a country code where a software service is hosted.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies a country or territory where a software service is located.
This includes indirect locations (e.g., where the data may be hosted).

The string shall be in the ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 &lt;https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso:3166:-1&gt; three-letter format.
See the ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 Wikipedia page &lt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-1_alpha-3&gt; for more information.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
